        |the garden once occupied by the Alraune
    ]. It's a decrepit mess of broken stone and upturned dirt, more weed than road.
    |The southern road leading to the Wayfort through [wayfort.hasAlraune
        |the alraune gardens
        |what was once the alraune gardens
    ] has been rebuilt. It could still use paving, but now any broken rocks have been removed, fresh dirt has been packed in that's at least all the same color, and the borders have been edged with stone. [wayfort.hasAlraune
        |It would also appear that some of the little plant-girls wandering around have planted a few bushes of less-luridly-inclined flowers
    ].
    |The southern road leads to the Wayfort, through [wayfort.hasAlraune
        |the alraune gardens
        |what was once the alraune gardens
    ]. It's not been neatly paved and mortared, the surface brushed to give the stone a little grip and traction to prevent armor-shod feet from slipping needlessly. 

    [wayfort.hasDaliza
        |One of Daliza's soldiers is patrolling the road, chatting with a hornet[wayfort.hasAlraune
            | and an effigy
        ]. [rand
            |He
            |She
        ] salutes you with an easy smile.
    ]
]

rows.translation:
[wayfort.stateABC
    |已经开辟出一条通往那里的小路。 [wayfort.hasAlraune
        |阿尔劳娜女主人的花园
        |那片曾经被阿尔劳妮占据的花园
    ]那是一片由碎石和翻起的泥土构成的破败景象，杂草丛生，几乎无法辨认出道路的痕迹。
    |通往荒废驿堡的南方道路[wayfort.hasAlraune
        |阿尔劳妮花园
        |曾经被称为阿尔劳妮花园的地方
    ]已经重新修建过了。虽然还需要铺设路面，但所有破损的石头都已经被清理掉，新的土壤也被填平了，而且这些土壤的颜色至少是统一的。此外，路边的边缘也用石头进行了装饰。 [wayfort.hasAlraune
        |看起来，那些在周围闲逛的小花精灵们也种了一些颜色不那么鲜艳的花丛
    ]。
    |南边的道路通向荒废驿堡，穿过那里即可到达。 [wayfort.hasAlraune
        |阿尔劳妮花园
        |曾经被称为阿尔劳妮花园的地方
    ]这些路面并没有经过整齐的铺砌和砂浆处理，表面也只是简单地进行了打磨，这样可以让石面具有一定的摩擦力和抓地力，从而避免穿着铠甲的脚部在不必要的情况下打滑。 

    [wayfort.hasDaliza
        |达莉莎的一名士兵正在道路上巡逻，同时与一只大黄蜂聊着天。[wayfort.hasAlraune
            | 以及一个模拟人像
        ]。 [rand
            |他
            |她
        ]她用一个轻松的微笑向你致意。
    ]
]

