rows.original:
]

[varena.atEmbers
    |Sitting at a table in the back of the bar, directly under one of the grand heroic frescoes, is a decidedly curvy figure with caramel skin and thick, dark hair spilling out from beneath a red cloak. A white corset's struggling to hold back her bovine bosom, and a metal-reinforced staff is leaning against the wall beside her. 

    No amount of disguising herself is going to stop anyone that knows her from recognizing First Princess Varena.
]

Leaning against a backdoor leading to the taphouse's storage room is [flags.JESSIE_THIEF_MET|the ginger-haired, tanned, half-mander tomboy [jessie.ku|Jessie|J]|a mysterious hooded half-mander, observing you curiously].

rows.translation:
]

[varena.atEmbers
    |坐在酒吧后面的桌子旁，正好位于那幅宏伟的英雄壁画下方，有一位身材曲线优美的女性：她拥有焦糖色的皮肤，浓密的黑发从红色斗篷下披散开来。一件白色的紧身胸衣努力地束缚着她那丰满的胸部，而一根装有金属加固装置的权杖则靠在她身旁的墙上。

    无论她如何伪装，对于那些认识她的人来说，都无法阻止他们认出瓦蕾娜第一公主的身份。
]

靠在通往酒馆储藏室的后门旁的是[flags.JESSIE_THIEF_MET|那个金发、皮肤黝黑、行为像男孩的女孩[jessie.ku|杰西|J]|一个神秘的面罩半人半兽生物，正好奇地注视着你]。

rows.original:
, the roars of excitement coming from within reverberate in your bones. There must be tens of thousands of people inside.

        [party.has bri
            |[first BRI_COLO
                |[bri.mf
                    |"Sounds like home alright," Brint says.
                    |"Yep, just like I left it," Brienne says.
                ]
            ]
        ]

        Even now there are people filing in, looking to catch the rest of the entertainment. It feels like everyone in the city wants to participate...

