rows.original:
[annika.numKids 1
                    |[rand
                        |At the seneschal's desk, two younger valkyries are oohing and aahing over Annika and the little bundle in her arms. Your beloved stud is carrying [annika.numKids 2
                            |one of your babies
                            |your baby
                        ] along with her as she works, gently rubbing a delicate ear and grinning happily as the younger sun warriors play peekaboo. One of them makes her golden wings shimmer into existence and laughs gaily as your child's eyes go wide. It could be really lovely to just sit there and watch for a little bit... or go talk to Anni and spend some more personal time with her and your bab[annika.numKids 2
                            |ies
                            |y
                        ].
                        |Anni's in her usual spot, sifting through the endless piles of paperwork with one hand while the other cradles [annika.numKids 2
                            |one of your children
                            |your baby
                        ]. Somehow, she looks like she's making progress through her work <i>and</i> keeping the baby from being unhappy. When she notices you, she gives you a cheerful wave — and directs your child's eyes in your direction too. They'd probably love to talk to [pc.Mommy], if [pc.heShe]'s — if you've — got the time.
                        |Looks like your valkyrie lover's taking a break for now — of sorts, anyway. She's not handling paperwork or mentoring or anything, but she <i>is</i> carrying around [annika.numKids 2
                            |one of your children
                            |your baby
                        ] and gently rocking them back and forth. Poor little bean was definitely crying earlier, but with Anni on the case, your little angel is looking peaceful and happy. They'd probably both love to visit with [pc.Mommy] right now.
                    ]
                    |[rand
                        |Annika's chatting with a pair of other valkyries, both young and ingenuous and full of stars in their eyes. From the way they're moving their hands around, it seems like they're talking about some sort of flying thing. Both of the younger women spend a lot of the time talking, but every time they look over at Anni, there's a clear sense of discipleship, as though she's teaching them something or speaking from authority. It looks, though, like they're nearly done with their conversation. You could probably go over and say hi if you'd like.
                        |At the side of the hall, Anni's seated at her new seneschal's table, complete with an absolute mountain of paperwork. Ah, the responsibilities of leadership. She's reading through it assiduously and making her own marks on it here and there, but despite her focus, she'd probably be grateful if you rescued her from her papers for a little while.
                        |You can see Anni walking into the hall again from one of the side chambers. She's as clean as a whistle, and in all fresh clothes too; judging by the bag she's holding and how wet her hair looks, the seneschal must've just washed off after working out. If she's between tasks, now's probably the perfect time to wander over and chat her up.[annika.fucked
                            | Hell, if you ask nicely, she'll probably even be willing to get all sweaty with you again, even though she's just cleaned up.
                        ]
                        |Anni's in the company of a pair of valkyries, one of them proudly holding a small elven child, several months old. She's cheerfully playing with the adorable little [silly
                            |bean
                            |nugget
                        ], cooing and making faces and playing peek-a-boo. [annika.pregStage 1
                            |As soon as she notices you approach, she directs the baby elf's eyes over toward you, saying something very effusive and happy in Alvarin. Gosh... you might have a thought about what she's saying, and it makes you put a hand to your [pc.belly] and smile. [annika.pregStage 3
                                |Soon enough
                                |Eventually
                            ] she'll be doing that with you and your little one[annika.numKids 2
                                |s
                            ].
                            |The baby seems utterly entranced, gazing at the seneschal with huge, cute eyes and slowly twitching its ears. Doesn't look like it can speak yet, but it does seem awfully happy.
                        ] As much fun as she's having, you're sure that she'd love to chat with you [annika.pregStage 1
                            |far
                            |even
                        ] more.
                    ]
                ]

rows.translation:
[annika.numKids 1
                    |[rand
                        |在总管的办公桌旁，两名年轻的女武神正围着安妮卡和她怀里的小家伙惊叹不已。你心爱的种马一边工作，一边带着[annika.numKids 2
                            |你的一个宝宝
                            |你的宝宝
                        ]，轻轻揉着那只娇嫩的小耳朵，开心地看着年轻的太阳战士们和孩子玩躲猫猫。其中一人让金色双翼闪耀着显现出来；看到你的孩子睁大眼睛，她快活地笑了起来。坐在这里看上一会儿一定很温馨……你也可以去找安妮聊聊，陪她和你的宝宝[annika.numKids 2
                            |
                            |
                        ]享受一段更亲密的家庭时光。
                        |安妮像往常一样待在自己的位置上，一只手翻阅堆积如山、仿佛永远处理不完的文件，另一只手则抱着[annika.numKids 2
                            |你的一个孩子
                            |你的宝宝
                        ]。不知怎的，她既能推进工作，<i>又</i>能让宝宝始终开开心心。注意到你后，她愉快地朝你挥了挥手，还把孩子的目光也引向你。她们大概都很想和[pc.Mommy]聊聊天，只要[pc.heShe]——也就是你——有空。
                        |看来你的女武神爱人正在休息——某种意义上算是吧。她没有处理文件，也没有指导别人，但她<i>正</i>抱着[annika.numKids 2
                            |你的一个孩子
                            |你的宝宝
                        ]，轻轻来回摇晃。可怜的小家伙先前显然哭过，不过既然有安妮照料，你的小天使现在显得安宁又快乐。她们俩此刻大概都很想见见[pc.Mommy]。
                    ]
                    |[rand
                        |安妮卡正在和两名年轻的女武神聊天；她们天真烂漫，眼中满是憧憬。从她们比划双手的动作来看，谈论的似乎是某种飞行技巧。两名年轻女子说了很多，但每当她们望向安妮时，神情中总带着明显的尊敬与仰慕，仿佛她正在传授知识，或以权威身份给予指导。不过，她们的谈话似乎快结束了。如果你愿意，现在大概可以过去打声招呼。
                        |大厅一侧，安妮坐在新的总管办公桌前，面前摆着一座名副其实的文件山。唉，这就是身居高位所要承担的责任。她正勤勉地逐份阅读，时不时在上面写下批注；不过即便如此专注，如果你能把她从文书工作中解救出来一会儿，她大概也会很感激。
                        |你看到安妮从一间侧室重新走进大厅。她浑身干干净净，还换上了一身新衣；从她提着的袋子和湿漉漉的头发来看，这位总管肯定刚在锻炼后洗过澡。如果她正好处于两项工作之间，现在应该是过去找她聊天的绝佳时机。[annika.fucked
                            |见鬼，只要你好好开口，她多半甚至愿意再次和你一起大汗淋漓，哪怕她才刚洗干净。
                        ]
                        |安妮正陪着两名女武神，其中一人骄傲地抱着一个才几个月大的精灵孩子。她开心地逗弄着这个可爱的[silly
                            |小豆丁
                            |小团子
                        ]，一边轻声哄着，一边做鬼脸、玩躲猫猫。[annika.pregStage 1
                            |她一注意到你走近，就把精灵宝宝的目光引向你，并用阿尔瓦林语说了些格外热情而愉快的话。天哪……你大概猜得到她说了什么；这个念头让你将一只手放在[pc.belly]上，露出微笑。[annika.pregStage 3
                                |很快
                                |终有一天
                            ]，她也会这样陪着你和你的小宝贝[annika.numKids 2
                                |
                            ]。
                            |宝宝显然完全被她吸引了，睁着又大又可爱的眼睛注视着这位总管，尖耳朵还在缓缓抽动。小家伙看起来还不会说话，但显然开心极了。
                        ]尽管她玩得十分开心，你确信她[annika.pregStage 1
                            |会格外
                            |也会更加
                        ]乐意与你聊聊。
                    ]
                ]

