rows.original:
You're standing in the remains of a small encampment, no doubt set up by the remnants of the prospecting crew. Shredded tents and broken tools lay strewn about, and a small pile of jagged stone appears blasted and scorched nearby– doubtless the aftermath of some desperate battle. [pc.isMage
    |The lingering energy of dark magic still stains the area
    |An unpleasant sensation seems to permeate the whole area
] as you look around, but you're certain the destroyed camp is abandoned. [party.solo
    |You are left deeply uneasy all the same, and being alone does not allay this
    |Despite having company, you feel deeply unsettled by the devastation of the area, a sentiment which [party.compNames] [party.oneCompanion
        |shares
        |both share
    ].
]

rows.translation:
你此刻正站在一片小型营地的废墟中，这片营地无疑是那些勘探队员留下的。破碎的帐篷、损坏的工具散落在各处，而在不远处，有一小堆参差不齐的石头，显然是被炸得粉碎、烧得焦黑的——这无疑是一场激烈战斗留下的痕迹。 [pc.isMage
    |黑暗魔法残留的能量至今仍影响着这片区域。
    |一种令人不适的感觉似乎弥漫了整个区域。
]当你环顾四周时，你会确信那个被毁掉的营地已经被人遗弃了。 [party.solo
    |你依然感到十分不安，而独处并不能缓解这种情绪。
    |尽管有同伴在身边，但这片地区的满目疮痍仍然让你们感到无比不安，这种情绪[party.compNames] [party.oneCompanion
        |股份
        |两者皆具备
    ]。
]

rows.original:
You've delivered Kaina's tea to Ashe... but the poor dragon isn't in a position to enjoy it; she has a debilitating injury, and only royalty can withdraw the spear pinning her wings. [flags.ASHE_SPEAR_CHOICE 1 2
    |This could be done by Azzy, all you have to do is bring her back to Ashe.
    |Evelyn's a princess; perhaps she can help?
    |Unfortunately you don't know any qualifying royalty...

    [flags.HIVE_CORRUPT
        |[flags.EVELYN_INTRO_LEFT
            |<b>This is as far as this quest progresses for now.</b>
        ]
    ]
]

rows.translation:
你已经把凯娜准备的茶送到了艾什手中……但那只可怜的龙根本无暇享用它；它受了严重的伤，只有王室成员才能拔出那根刺住它翅膀的长矛。 [flags.ASHE_SPEAR_CHOICE 1 2
    |这件事可以由阿齐来完成，你只需要把她带回Ashe身边就可以了。
    |伊芙琳是一位公主，也许她能帮忙吧？
    |不幸的是，你并不了解任何与版税相关的规定或细节……

    [flags.HIVE_CORRUPT
        |[flags.EVELYN_INTRO_LEFT
            |<b>目前，这个任务就进展到这个阶段了。</b>
        ]
    ]
]

rows.original:
[flags.KQ_THARSUS_DEF
    |Unfortunately, the warlock-captain escaped before you could defeat. Nevertheless, you don't think you'll be seeing Tharsus again any time soon. That just means Refnir is the last remaining captain you have to deal with.
    |[flags.KQ_REFNIR_DEF
        |The warden-captain has been dealt with, that just leaves Tharsus.
    ]
]

